1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Eighth Episode
The Black Knight
Knight's Law

15
00:01:58,179 --> 00:02:03,340
Let's see... <i>First of all, a fighting dog is a dog that knows nothing but fighting</i>.

16
00:02:04,279 --> 00:02:07,770
<i>To raise one, you separate it from its mother as young as possible</i>

17
00:02:07,795 --> 00:02:10,300
<i>so it learns to stand on its own.</i>

18
00:02:10,945 --> 00:02:13,638
<i>Then you teach it only to fight, </i>

19
00:02:13,662 --> 00:02:17,480
<i>making it forget all emotions like sadness or joy.</i>

20
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:21,639
Still, a dog without emotions... What a poor thing.

21
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:27,420
Good morning, Dr. Uranari.

22
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,146
Ah, good morning.

23
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:30,000
What are you reading?

24
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,431
Ah, well...

25
00:02:31,455 --> 00:02:33,971
<i>All that fills its head is the enemy.</i>

26
00:02:33,995 --> 00:02:36,440
<i>And fighting that enemy.</i>

27
00:02:36,785 --> 00:02:38,153
What's that about?

28
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:40,066
Don't you know?

29
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:43,500
It's about fighting dogs. Dogs stripped of their emotions.

30
00:02:45,850 --> 00:02:47,060
Ah, a dog!

31
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,966
I hate snakes and dogs.

32
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:56,300
Oh, this dog is Grand Duke Duralumin's pet.

33
00:02:56,553 --> 00:02:59,705
I don't believe an animal can be emotionless.

34
00:02:59,729 --> 00:03:04,781
No matter what kind of dog it is, if you show it affection, it'll understand.

35
00:03:04,806 --> 00:03:06,780
Aw, cute little doggy.

36
00:03:07,573 --> 00:03:09,473
See? Just as I thought.

37
00:03:10,626 --> 00:03:11,980
Ouch!

38
00:03:13,609 --> 00:03:14,682
Help me!

39
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:19,903
Is something wrong with my pet, Dr. Uranari?

40
00:03:20,365 --> 00:03:21,380
Grand Duke Duralumin

41
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:26,513
If you don't keep it inside its kennel, it's dangerous! Even if it is just a pet!

42
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:31,091
There, there. What's wrong?

43
00:03:31,115 --> 00:03:35,458
Anyone bitten by such a cute creature must be totally out of their mind.

44
00:03:35,482 --> 00:03:38,630
But more importantly, I'll show you something even better later.

45
00:03:38,654 --> 00:03:39,581
Something better?

46
00:03:39,606 --> 00:03:41,360
You'll see later.

47
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:43,540
Like what?

48
00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:46,240
Did you just say <i>I'm</i> out of my mind?!

49
00:03:58,210 --> 00:04:00,396
Who put a rope across a place like this?

50
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:03,540
This hallway is the shortcut to Sapphire's room.

51
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:25,640
What a terrifying dog, attacking for no reason.

52
00:04:32,006 --> 00:04:33,006
Lord Sapphire!

53
00:04:33,091 --> 00:04:33,857
Lord Sapphire!

54
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:37,685
Are you alright, Lord Sapphire?

55
00:04:37,710 --> 00:04:38,155
Yeah!

56
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,520
Why, you... still trying to fight back?

57
00:04:41,685 --> 00:04:42,685
Hey, you brute!

58
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,200
Wait, everyone!

59
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,614
Could this dog be...

60
00:04:46,638 --> 00:04:49,360
Hey, what's wrong with my fighting dog?

61
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,175
Fighting dog?

62
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:53,532
Well, well. Lord Sapphire, coming out in person?

63
00:04:53,695 --> 00:04:55,320
This is what a fine specimen looks like.

64
00:04:55,525 --> 00:04:57,564
A fine specimen? You meant this fighting dog?

65
00:04:58,055 --> 00:04:59,575
Putting him in the room!

66
00:04:59,638 --> 00:04:59,959
Yes.

67
00:05:10,517 --> 00:05:14,727
Take a good look, Lord Sapphire. See what a fighting dog really is.

68
00:05:30,170 --> 00:05:32,516
Isn't it awful to put a dog through something like this?

69
00:05:33,380 --> 00:05:34,900
Awful, you say?

70
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:40,317
A fighting dog is raised through relentless torment. Come over here.

71
00:05:40,827 --> 00:05:42,825
Look at the dog in this room.

72
00:05:43,763 --> 00:05:45,920
Up to here, it's just like the other one.

73
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:52,310
Look, this is that fighting dog's mother.

74
00:05:52,349 --> 00:05:53,374
It's mother.

75
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:58,960
Stop it! Hey, that's your mother right there! Don't you recognize her?

76
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,680
Will it never be able to act like a normal dog again?

77
00:06:06,780 --> 00:06:11,900
That's impossible. Dogs don't feel parent-child affection like humans do.

78
00:06:13,525 --> 00:06:16,200
Poor thing, forgetting your own mother...

79
00:06:31,610 --> 00:06:35,720
Dr. Uranari, isn't there any way to turn those vicious hounds back into normal dogs?

80
00:06:37,179 --> 00:06:40,809
Since they've already been trained to that extreme, I'm afraid it's too late.

81
00:06:41,355 --> 00:06:44,378
Grand Duke Duralumin's growing arrogance is quite a problem.

82
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:48,933
It bloomed! It bloomed before I knew it! Beautiful!

83
00:06:49,045 --> 00:06:50,600
I raised this myself.

84
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:53,975
Hey, Dr. Uranari, can I go to the border?

85
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:55,180
To the border?

86
00:06:57,390 --> 00:07:00,147
I promised to give them to Franze once the tulips bloom.

87
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:22,880
Whoa! It won't stop!

88
00:07:25,407 --> 00:07:27,327
Hey! Stop right there! I said stop!

89
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:33,360
How dare you get in my way!

90
00:07:33,810 --> 00:07:36,500
Who goes there?! Beyond this point lies Silverland!

91
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:37,931
Shut up!

92
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:43,420
So you wanna fight?! Get him, boys!

93
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:05,460
You bunch of cowards! I am Jingisu, an apprentice knight of Bururu!

94
00:08:06,005 --> 00:08:08,660
Doesn't your kingdom have a princess named Sapphire who boasts of her skill?

95
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,000
What? Then Lord Sapphire...

96
00:08:11,150 --> 00:08:13,813
That's right. Defeat just one more famous knight,

97
00:08:13,837 --> 00:08:15,840
and I'll become an official knight.

98
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:18,126
And that knight is Sapphire.

99
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:20,499
Now, lead the way!

100
00:08:46,812 --> 00:08:47,624
Lord Sapphire!

101
00:08:48,981 --> 00:08:49,981
What?!

102
00:08:52,619 --> 00:08:53,751
Isn't that the border guard?!

103
00:08:53,775 --> 00:08:54,780
What happened?!

104
00:08:54,781 --> 00:08:56,963
It's terrible! This man is after Lord Sapphire...

105
00:08:58,499 --> 00:08:59,800
Are you Sapphire?!

106
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:02,525
Who are you? Do you have business with me?

107
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:05,558
Now, duel me!

108
00:09:05,765 --> 00:09:07,480
You may be a girl, but you're a famous knight!

109
00:09:07,905 --> 00:09:11,440
If I defeat you, the King of Bururu will grant me knighthood!

110
00:09:11,575 --> 00:09:12,575
Bring it on!

111
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:16,166
We've only just met, and you already want to fight...

112
00:09:16,925 --> 00:09:18,420
I've got somewhere to go right now!

113
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:20,260
Running away?!

114
00:09:20,939 --> 00:09:22,740
Precious tulips for France!

115
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:24,887
And you call yourself Jingisu?!

116
00:09:25,345 --> 00:09:27,240
All right! If a fight is what you want, you've got one!

117
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,971
Now, draw your sword!

118
00:09:31,145 --> 00:09:31,791
Mama!

119
00:09:32,807 --> 00:09:33,439
Mama!

120
00:09:35,019 --> 00:09:37,120
Is something wrong with that tulip?

121
00:09:37,565 --> 00:09:39,500
My mom loved tulips.

122
00:09:40,175 --> 00:09:43,061
So whenever I see one, it always reminds me of her.

123
00:09:44,625 --> 00:09:45,900
Mama!

124
00:09:47,370 --> 00:09:48,640
Mama!

125
00:09:50,579 --> 00:09:52,081
Mama!

126
00:09:54,135 --> 00:09:55,900
Mama!

127
00:10:01,655 --> 00:10:03,880
You don't have a mother, do you?

128
00:10:04,246 --> 00:10:09,542
Yeah. After my dad died and our family fell apart, my mom saw me crying...

129
00:10:10,075 --> 00:10:13,037
...said a crybaby wasn't her child, and walked out.

130
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,620
I was abandoned like a stray pup.

131
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:21,207
Jingisu...so you're trying to become a knight to rebuild your family's name?

132
00:10:22,034 --> 00:10:22,941
Watch out!

133
00:10:27,944 --> 00:10:29,370
Damn it! The Black Knight!

134
00:10:29,878 --> 00:10:31,078
He followed me all the way here?!

135
00:10:32,315 --> 00:10:34,940
He's been targeting me ever since I was a toddler!

136
00:10:37,969 --> 00:10:39,213
I don't care about the Black Knight!

137
00:10:39,706 --> 00:10:40,960
Right now, I just need to defeat you!

138
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,400
Damn it!

139
00:11:01,719 --> 00:11:02,812
Look out! An avalanche!

140
00:12:11,176 --> 00:12:13,060
Help me!

141
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:26,640
Somebody!

142
00:12:28,039 --> 00:12:30,320
Lord Sapphire!

143
00:12:31,319 --> 00:12:33,560
Lord Sapphire!

144
00:12:47,430 --> 00:12:48,285
You're safe!

145
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:50,500
Jingisu!

146
00:12:54,439 --> 00:12:57,019
Jingisu!

147
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:07,927
Jingisu!

148
00:13:18,378 --> 00:13:19,547
There you are!

149
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:22,380
Quick, hold onto this!

150
00:13:25,049 --> 00:13:26,280
What?! As if I'd...

151
00:13:26,479 --> 00:13:28,182
Like I'd let my opponent save me!

152
00:13:29,003 --> 00:13:29,940
You fool!

153
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:32,026
What did you say?!

154
00:13:43,659 --> 00:13:44,573
Listen, everyone!

155
00:13:44,722 --> 00:13:49,143
Forget about dueling Sapphire and hurry back to your own countries!

156
00:13:50,472 --> 00:13:51,236
Mark my words...

157
00:13:51,604 --> 00:13:53,300
We will definitely settle this once and for all!

158
00:13:57,680 --> 00:14:01,117
This rope won't break, so climb on up!

159
00:14:11,189 --> 00:14:13,880
Opal, what's wrong? Why did you stop all of a sudden?

160
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,520
This is that Black Knight's glove.

161
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:35,126
Drink some of Mother's tea. You must be cold, right? Let's have hot tea and cake.

162
00:14:35,689 --> 00:14:37,842
Thank you, Mother.

163
00:14:37,900 --> 00:14:39,712
What's wrong? Are you lost in thought?

164
00:14:40,389 --> 00:14:41,790
Here, try this glove on.

165
00:14:41,930 --> 00:14:43,220
It's a black glove.

166
00:14:43,405 --> 00:14:44,283
Is it big?

167
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,631
No, it fits Mother perfectly.

168
00:14:46,752 --> 00:14:48,940
A perfect fit? The Black Knight is...

169
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:54,340
What's all this commotion?

170
00:14:58,820 --> 00:15:01,520
Out of my way! If you won't let me pass, I'll force my way through!

171
00:15:04,709 --> 00:15:06,768
An intruder! Don't let him into the castle!

172
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:20,188
Bring Sapphire out! Where is Sapphire? Sapphire!

173
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:21,636
Wait a moment!

174
00:15:21,691 --> 00:15:22,427
Stand back!

175
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:24,370
Sapphire!

176
00:15:25,027 --> 00:15:26,318
Sapphire!

177
00:15:28,979 --> 00:15:31,212
Trying to take me on is laughable!

178
00:15:58,110 --> 00:15:58,860
Who's there!

179
00:16:00,583 --> 00:16:01,209
Dogs!

180
00:16:30,019 --> 00:16:31,280
They're like wild beasts!

181
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:34,730
Alright, you hounds, come at me!

182
00:16:36,601 --> 00:16:37,382
Who's there!

183
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:42,760
You lot, get back to your rooms!

184
00:16:45,699 --> 00:16:48,858
I am Grand Duke Duralumin. What is your name?

185
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:51,472
I am Jingisu, a knight-in-training from the Land of Bururu.

186
00:16:51,934 --> 00:16:53,965
I've come to challenge Princess Sapphire to a duel.

187
00:16:54,199 --> 00:16:55,238
Let me see Sapphire.

188
00:16:55,637 --> 00:16:58,558
I have a formal challenge signed by the King of Bururu.

189
00:16:58,770 --> 00:16:59,480
Look at this.

190
00:17:00,349 --> 00:17:01,540
To Sapphire, is it?

191
00:17:03,639 --> 00:17:05,689
He looks as sharp as a blade.

192
00:17:05,713 --> 00:17:08,158
Handed a formal challenge to a duel signed by the King,

193
00:17:08,182 --> 00:17:11,140
Sapphire won't be able to refuse as a knight.

194
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:12,936
Then take me to her already!

195
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:16,119
Don't be in such a rush. Come this way.

196
00:17:16,326 --> 00:17:18,767
Fine! If you want to fight that badly, I'll take you on!

197
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:20,520
Please wait, Lord Sapphire.

198
00:17:21,094 --> 00:17:23,020
Doctor Uranari, let go of my cloak!

199
00:17:23,439 --> 00:17:27,000
Lord Sapphire, do you hold a grudge against that boy?

200
00:17:27,144 --> 00:17:28,377
Not really, but...

201
00:17:28,401 --> 00:17:31,104
And that boy holds no grudge against you either.

202
00:17:31,599 --> 00:17:35,738
It is only this code of knighthood that forces him to defeat a famous knight.

203
00:17:35,789 --> 00:17:39,640
But if I run away, I'll become everyone's laughingstock!

204
00:17:39,929 --> 00:17:41,457
Please call off this match.

205
00:17:41,764 --> 00:17:45,880
Weren't you supposed to be the one who breaks bad rules and creates new ones?

206
00:18:05,859 --> 00:18:07,460
Haven't you gone to bed yet?

207
00:18:07,584 --> 00:18:09,200
You're sure it'll be done tomorrow?

208
00:18:10,589 --> 00:18:14,500
Leave it to me. Get a good rest tonight.

209
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:16,575
You'd better be right!

210
00:18:23,740 --> 00:18:24,740
Who's there?!

211
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:26,380
A tulip!

212
00:18:27,014 --> 00:18:31,420
Damn it! Whenever I see this flower, I always think of my mother!

213
00:18:31,519 --> 00:18:34,640
Jingisu! Jingisu! It's your mother!

214
00:18:34,665 --> 00:18:37,024
Mama! Mama! Where are you?

215
00:18:37,479 --> 00:18:40,700
Jingisu! Listen to me! Stop fighting!

216
00:18:42,069 --> 00:18:44,885
Jingisu, you are not a dog.

217
00:18:44,909 --> 00:18:49,140
Fighting like a mindless weapon to become a knight won't bring you happiness.

218
00:18:50,114 --> 00:18:54,520
Listen to me, Jingisu. You weren't born just to fight.

219
00:18:56,949 --> 00:18:58,135
It's too late, Mama.

220
00:18:58,159 --> 00:19:01,030
I've turned so many into my enemies and fought desperately.

221
00:19:01,979 --> 00:19:03,885
Fighting is all I know how to do now.

222
00:19:04,494 --> 00:19:05,345
Mama,

223
00:19:05,815 --> 00:19:07,330
where are you?

224
00:19:08,719 --> 00:19:10,080
What's wrong, Jingisu?

225
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:11,460
What the—?!

226
00:19:15,699 --> 00:19:17,427
What is the meaning of this, Grand Duke Duralumin?!

227
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:24,300
He's finally back to his senses. You're still not a true weapon.

228
00:19:27,069 --> 00:19:31,197
At this rate, you'll never defeat Sapphire and finish her off!

229
00:19:32,219 --> 00:19:35,042
I'll do it! I will do it! Just watch me!

230
00:19:36,349 --> 00:19:37,728
We failed.

231
00:19:38,690 --> 00:19:41,340
Looks like there's no choice but to fight after all.

232
00:19:57,209 --> 00:19:59,860
Lord Sapphire!

233
00:19:59,975 --> 00:20:02,540
Lord Sapphire!

234
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:05,882
Lord Sapphire!

235
00:20:06,229 --> 00:20:08,903
Lord Sapphire!

236
00:20:12,048 --> 00:20:16,039
What? Sapphire is missing? Where could she have gone, Dr. Uranari?

237
00:20:16,160 --> 00:20:17,025
I... have no idea...

238
00:20:17,744 --> 00:20:21,595
She ran away. It seems Silverland's heir is a coward.

239
00:20:21,619 --> 00:20:26,545
Duke Duralumin! You go too far! I've had enough of these rumors!

240
00:20:27,134 --> 00:20:30,340
If this happens, we won't be able to face other nations.

241
00:20:31,629 --> 00:20:33,496
Where on earth could Sapphire have gone?

242
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:35,220
Your Magesty, actually...

243
00:20:36,209 --> 00:20:36,943
Sapphire!

244
00:20:37,026 --> 00:20:38,549
Sapphire!

245
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:41,140
Come out, you coward, Sapphire!

246
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,213
Where are you hiding?!

247
00:20:43,643 --> 00:20:44,997
Are you that scared of me?!

248
00:20:45,354 --> 00:20:46,587
Where are you, Sapphire?!

249
00:20:48,338 --> 00:20:49,549
You spineless Sapphire!

250
00:20:49,823 --> 00:20:50,419
Come out!

251
00:21:04,139 --> 00:21:06,940
Dear God, please understand. I am not hiding because I am afraid.

252
00:21:14,858 --> 00:21:16,010
There you are, Sapphire!

253
00:21:16,237 --> 00:21:17,111
Hiding won't work.

254
00:21:17,307 --> 00:21:18,854
My nose is better than a dog's!

255
00:21:22,229 --> 00:21:23,300
Jingisu, please!

256
00:21:23,425 --> 00:21:24,860
Please give up on this foolish fight!

257
00:21:24,969 --> 00:21:26,340
First, pick whichever weapon you like!

258
00:21:26,430 --> 00:21:27,040
Jingisu!

259
00:21:27,139 --> 00:21:28,580
Begging for mercy? Did you lose your nerve?

260
00:21:28,819 --> 00:21:30,279
All right! I'll use the whip!

261
00:21:30,340 --> 00:21:32,380
All right! Let the match begin!

262
00:21:46,169 --> 00:21:47,380
Stop it, Jingisu!

263
00:21:48,126 --> 00:21:49,025
It's the Black Knight!

264
00:21:50,193 --> 00:21:51,420
A woman?!

265
00:21:53,204 --> 00:21:53,814
Mama!

266
00:21:54,205 --> 00:21:54,970
Mama!

267
00:21:55,487 --> 00:21:56,361
Mama!

268
00:21:57,309 --> 00:21:57,877
Jingisu!

269
00:21:57,901 --> 00:21:58,666
Mama!

270
00:21:58,690 --> 00:22:01,960
Forgive your Mama. Mama saw everything.

271
00:22:02,581 --> 00:22:08,120
To rebuild our fallen family, I disguised myself as the Black Knight to train you.

272
00:22:08,799 --> 00:22:10,228
But I realized our people's rule—

273
00:22:10,252 --> 00:22:12,485
that simply defeating the strong is all that matters—

274
00:22:12,510 --> 00:22:14,760
was foolish and wrong.

275
00:22:15,424 --> 00:22:17,640
Mama was wrong. Please forgive me.

276
00:22:18,639 --> 00:22:19,640
Mama!

277
00:22:25,949 --> 00:22:28,680
That dog turned into a human.

278
00:22:36,229 --> 00:22:37,560
Goodbye, Lord Sapphire.

279
00:22:38,149 --> 00:22:40,561
Sapphire, I'll never forget you. Bye!

280
00:22:40,945 --> 00:22:41,945
Yeah, me neither!

281
00:22:42,514 --> 00:22:43,760
Goodbye!

282
00:22:44,019 --> 00:22:45,776
I wish you all the best!

